# graduation/ — moving past hosted

Series discipline is the hosted-human series' own (one life in order; the person is created by
the story and removed by it; judged from the portal and from the doorway's own answers), with
one addition: **who acts is part of the claim.** A graduation step that an operator or an agent
could take on a person's behalf is not graduation, so each station asserts both that the human
can take it and that nobody else can.

**Considered, no enforcing rule beyond the parent's.** This manifest satisfies the parent
`genesis/a2o/.epr-meta` no-orphan-subtree rule and claims coverage; the blind-reader obligation
is inherited.
